{
  "title": "101: Al-Qaari'a القارعة",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "This is a ‘Makki’ Surah which has 11 verses. Imam Muhammad al-Baqir (a.s.) has said that the person who frequently recites this Surah will be saved from the heat of hellfire.\nIf a businessman or a person in financial difficulties keeps this Surah in his possession, the doors of sustenance will be opened to him. Recitation of this Surah in prayers also increases in one’s sustenance. Water in which this Surah has been dissolved is useful in keeping away unwanted pests (e.g. Insects and rodents).\nبِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMIL LAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-merciful, the All-compassionate\nاَلْقَارِعَةُ ۙ‏(1)\nALQAARE-A’TO. \nThe terrible calamity! \nمَا الْقَارِعَةُ ۚ‏(2)\nMAL QAARE-A’H. \nWhat is the terrible calamity! \nوَمَاۤ اَدْرٰٮكَ مَا الْقَارِعَةُ ؕ‏(3)\nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAL QAARE-A’H. \nAnd what will make you comprehend what the terrible calamity is? \nيَوْمَ يَكُوْنُ النَّاسُ كَالْفَرَاشِ الْمَبْثُوْثِۙ‏(4)\nYAWMA YAKOONUN NAASO KAL-FARAASHIL MABSOOSE. \nThe day on which men shall be as scattered moths, \nوَتَكُوْنُ الْجِبَالُ كَالْعِهْنِ الْمَنْفُوْشِؕ‏(5)\nWA TAKOONUL JEBAALO KAL-E’HNIL MANFOOSH. \nAnd the mountains shall be as loosened wool. \nفَاَمَّا مَنْ ثَقُلَتْ مَوَازِيْنُهٗ ۙ‏(6)\nFA-AMMAA MAN SAQOLAT MAWAAZEENOHU. \nThen as for him whose measure of good deeds is heavy, \nفَهُوَ فِىْ عِيْشَةٍ رَّاضِيَةٍ ؕ‏(7)\nFAHOWA FEE E’ESHATIR RAAZEYAH. \nHe shall live a pleasant life. \nوَاَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَازِيْنُهٗ ۙ‏(8)\nWA AMMAA MAN KHAFFAT MAWAAZEENOHU. \nAnd as for him whose measure of good deeds is light, \nفَاُمُّهٗ هَاوِيَةٌ ؕ‏(9)\nFA-UMMOHU HAAWEYAH. \nHis abode shall be the abyss. \nوَمَاۤ اَدْرٰٮكَ مَا هِيَهْ ؕ‏(10)\nWA MAA ADRAAKA MAA HEYAH. \nAnd what will make you know what it is? \nنَارٌ حَامِيَةٌ‏(11)\nNAARUN HAAMEYAH\nA burning fire. "
}
